    {
      "name": "Bant",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "Uyarı/hata/bilgi/nötr bandı; köken mürekkebi taşımaz.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-banner\" role=\"status\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg><div><strong>Otomatik kontrol yapılamadı</strong><div class=\"ds-sub\">Manuel inceleme tam olarak çalışır.</div></div></div>",
